  "genNudgeModule4a": "You've reached Module 4: light, noise, and microbreaks. Take a 20–30 second microbreak now — then continue to Module 5 to cover lifting basics.",
  "@genNudgeModule4a": {
    "description": "E-learning reminder nudge shown as an in-app banner"
