    "description": "E-learning reminder nudge shown as an in-app banner"
  },
  "genNudgeModule5a": "You've seen safe lifting in Module 5. Keep loads close and avoid twisting. When your schedule allows, start Module 6 to apply ergonomics at home or remotely.",
